sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Task as Task/Planner
  participant KB as Knowledge API
  participant Index as FTS + Vector Index
  participant Rank as Ranker
  participant Filter as Status/Scope Guard
  participant Packet as Retrieval Packet
  participant EV as Event Log
  Task->>KB: retrieve(query, project, device, tags)
  KB->>Index: search text + metadata
  Index-->>KB: candidate chunks
  KB->>Rank: BM25 + status + recency
  Rank->>Filter: filter RBAC + stale/disputed
  Filter-->>Packet: approved/corroborated hits
  alt 无命中
    Packet-->>Task: no_history
  else 有命中
    Packet-->>Task: hits + why_matched + citations
    Packet->>Task: warnings + differences + reusable_blocks
  end
  KB->>EV: append retrieval.completed
  Note over KB,Packet: 检索结果按不可信证据注入；不能覆盖平台硬约束
